<title>USA: Gabelli picks undervalued shrs - Barron's.</title>
<headline>Gabelli picks undervalued shrs - Barron's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four top money managers interviewed in Monday's edition of Barron's, the financial weekly, listed their favorite underappreciated stocks.</p>
<p>Mario Gabelli, chairman and chief investment officer of Gamco Inc, picked the following issues:</p>
<p>Giant Food Inc</p>
<p>Delchamps Inc</p>
<p>GC Cos Inc</p>
<p>Curtiss-Wright Corp</p>
<p>Jackpot Enterprises Inc</p>
<p>Rollins Inc</p>
<p>Greif Bros</p>
<p>BHC Communications Inc</p>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc</p>
<p>Belding Heminway Co Inc</p>
<p>Tyler Corp</p>
<p>Core Materials</p>
<p>General Host Corp</p>
<p>Raytech Corp</p>
<p>Thomas Industries Inc</p>
<p>Aztar Corp</p>
<p>Goulds Pumps Inc</p>
<p>Quaker Oats Co</p>
<p>International Family Entertainment Inc</p>
<p>BET Holdings</p>
<p>Liberty Media</p>
<p>HSN Inc</p>
<p>Viacom Inc</p>
<p>Time Warner Inc</p>
<p>Southwest Gas Corp.</p>
<p>Gabelli said his current least favorite stocks include Santa Anita Realty Enterprises Inc and Media General Inc.</p>
</text>
